								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I believe Moonlight Crusaders and Dawning Nemesis are tied.&nbsp; <br /><br />DN is in PoTime farm status and has progressed to Ikkinz4 in GoD.&nbsp; I know Moonlight Crusaders is also farming Time, but unsure on their GoD progression.<br /><br />OoW not a major focus for DN yet, but we have downed mobs such as Hulcror, Feratha, and Chailak.<br /><br />&quot;Redeemer&quot; Presea &lt;Dawning Nemesis&gt;<br />70 Lady Paladin<br />Rodcet Nife
